# Normalize text files to LF in the repo. No eol= on purpose: the owner works
# on Windows (core.autocrlf true), so his checkout keeps CRLF.
* text=auto

# Binary assets: never convert or diff as text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
